    "detailed_description": "Astraverse is a 2D Choose Your Own Adventure Sci-fi Fantasy Beat \u2018em up RPG hybrid for up to 4 players that places a significant emphasis on custom character building and cooperative decision-making that not only changes the course of the overall narrative but also the story of each player\u2019s character.<br><br>Register yourself as a Seeker, an interplanetary sword-for-hire that works to assist and protect the people of the Ze're Star System. Featuring the most detailed character creation system in any 2D action RPG in existence! Choose your class, race, outfit, hair, hair color, eyes, and more!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1632630/extras/cd6e3b477340be857227d452e292fb01.poster.avif?t=1709758951\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1632630/extras/cd6e3b477340be857227d452e292fb01.webm?t=1709758951\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1632630/extras/cd6e3b477340be857227d452e292fb01.mp4?t=1709758951\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>As a Seeker, venture out to different planets across the Ze're system and discover the secrets of universe!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1632630/extras/e490d8b5b0db09d65b68eb6ade973188.poster.avif?t=1709758951\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1632630/extras/e490d8b5b0db09d65b68eb6ade973188.webm?t=1709758951\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1632630/extras/e490d8b5b0db09d65b68eb6ade973188.mp4?t=1709758951\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Explore each planet in beautiful hand-drawn environments! Fight against the Parablights to protect the star system in an action battle system reminiscent of classic beat 'em ups!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1632630/extras/63738a0adf3cdc3c8c9b6c79acc7250c.poster.avif?t=1709758951\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1632630/extras/63738a0adf3cdc3c8c9b6c79acc7250c.webm?t=1709758951\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1632630/extras/63738a0adf3cdc3c8c9b6c79acc7250c.mp4?t=1709758951\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Choose your own adventure through immersive text-based encounters that can alter your quest based on your choices!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1632630/extras/c7f19e4e34e0b39ec338b287558e387d.poster.avif?t=1709758951\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1632630/extras/c7f19e4e34e0b39ec338b287558e387d.webm?t=1709758951\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1632630/extras/c7f19e4e34e0b39ec338b287558e387d.mp4?t=1709758951\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Enjoy a uniquely immersive adventure either solo or in a party of up to 4!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1632630/extras/5efcd45c7a3c2574d1c69149cfb4e8c4.poster.avif?t=1709758951\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1632630/extras/5efcd45c7a3c2574d1c69149cfb4e8c4.webm?t=1709758951\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1632630/extras/5efcd45c7a3c2574d1c69149cfb4e8c4.mp4?t=1709758951\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "Astraverse is a 2D Choose Your Own Adventure Sci-fi Fantasy Beat \u2018em up RPG hybrid for up to 4 players that places a significant emphasis on custom character building and cooperative decision-making that not only changes the course of the overall narrative but also the story of each player\u2019s character.<br><br>Register yourself as a Seeker, an interplanetary sword-for-hire that works to assist and protect the people of the Ze're Star System. Featuring the most detailed character creation system in any 2D action RPG in existence! Choose your class, race, outfit, hair, hair color, eyes, and more!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1632630/extras/cd6e3b477340be857227d452e292fb01.poster.avif?t=1709758951\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1632630/extras/cd6e3b477340be857227d452e292fb01.webm?t=1709758951\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1632630/extras/cd6e3b477340be857227d452e292fb01.mp4?t=1709758951\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>As a Seeker, venture out to different planets across the Ze're system and discover the secrets of universe!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1632630/extras/e490d8b5b0db09d65b68eb6ade973188.poster.avif?t=1709758951\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1632630/extras/e490d8b5b0db09d65b68eb6ade973188.webm?t=1709758951\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1632630/extras/e490d8b5b0db09d65b68eb6ade973188.mp4?t=1709758951\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Explore each planet in beautiful hand-drawn environments! Fight against the Parablights to protect the star system in an action battle system reminiscent of classic beat 'em ups!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1632630/extras/63738a0adf3cdc3c8c9b6c79acc7250c.poster.avif?t=1709758951\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1632630/extras/63738a0adf3cdc3c8c9b6c79acc7250c.webm?t=1709758951\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1632630/extras/63738a0adf3cdc3c8c9b6c79acc7250c.mp4?t=1709758951\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Choose your own adventure through immersive text-based encounters that can alter your quest based on your choices!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1632630/extras/c7f19e4e34e0b39ec338b287558e387d.poster.avif?t=1709758951\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1632630/extras/c7f19e4e34e0b39ec338b287558e387d.webm?t=1709758951\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1632630/extras/c7f19e4e34e0b39ec338b287558e387d.mp4?t=1709758951\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Enjoy a uniquely immersive adventure either solo or in a party of up to 4!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1632630/extras/5efcd45c7a3c2574d1c69149cfb4e8c4.poster.avif?t=1709758951\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1632630/extras/5efcd45c7a3c2574d1c69149cfb4e8c4.webm?t=1709758951\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1632630/extras/5efcd45c7a3c2574d1c69149cfb4e8c4.mp4?t=1709758951\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
